---
import LegalLayout from '../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import site from '../../../site.config.mjs';
const host = new URL(site.url).host;
---
<LegalLayout title="Privacy policy" description={`How ${host} handles personal information.`}>
  <p>{host} is a portfolio of photographs by {site.legal.owner}. It shows only my own work. It has no user accounts, contact forms, comments, advertising or analytics.</p>

  <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
  <p>{site.legal.owner} is responsible for this website. You can contact me at <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a>.</p>

  <h2>What this site collects</h2>
  <p>I don’t collect, store or sell personal information through this site. The site doesn’t set cookies or use local storage, and it doesn’t load trackers, advertising, embedded third-party content or third-party fonts.</p>

  <h2>Hosting and server logs</h2>
  <p>The site and its photographs are delivered through Cloudflare, Inc. To deliver pages, keep the site secure and prevent abuse, Cloudflare necessarily processes technical information such as your IP address, browser type, the pages requested and timestamps. I don’t use this information to identify visitors. Cloudflare may process it in countries other than your own. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener">Cloudflare’s privacy policy</a> for details.</p>

  <h2>If you email me</h2>
  <p>If you contact me, I’ll use your email address and message only to reply and to keep a record of the conversation. I won’t share it, add you to a mailing list, or use it for anything else. I keep correspondence only as long as it’s useful or required, then delete it.</p>

  <h2>People who appear in photographs</h2>
  <p>Some photographs include people. If you appear in a photograph and would like it removed, email me with the collection and frame and I will take it down promptly.</p>

  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>This site may link to other websites, such as social media profiles. I’m not responsible for their content or privacy practices.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live (for example under the GDPR, UK GDPR, PIPEDA or CCPA/CPRA), you may have the right to ask what personal information I hold about you, to correct or delete it, and to complain to your local privacy regulator. Email me and I’ll respond as soon as I can.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This site isn’t directed at children and doesn’t knowingly collect information from anyone.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If this policy changes, the date at the top of the page will be updated.</p>
</LegalLayout>
